  "instructions": [
    "Heat large pot of water to boiling",
    "Salt water",
    "Add past and cook according to package directions until tender but still firm to the bite",
    "Drain , cool under cold running water , and drain again",
    "Toast pine nuts in a small skillet over low heat until golden",
    "Transfer pasta to large bowl",
    "In small bowl , combine oil , vinegar , and lemon zest",
    "Pour over pasta and toss to coat",
    "Add nuts , olives , and parsley and combine thoroughly",
    "Gently stir in tomatoes , shrimp , and cheese , season to taste with salt and pepper",
    "You can serve at once , or you can refrigerate and serve cold"
